        <mxCell id="c66" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;No graceful exit within the stop timeout (120 s) and no job running: the process tree is terminated (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:ui-monospace,SF Mono,Cascadia Mono,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Action::Kill&lt;/span&gt;). A runner that exits again and again enters a crash loop.&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#14171C,#ECEEF1);rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#C4C7CD,#353A42);fillColor=light-dark(#F0F2F5,#1B1E23);align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="528" y="1468" width="400" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
